Printed Eq.(85) overlaps J_1=0 with the dual +dI clause at p=0;
changed the first dual value to dI because its right-addition content is d. -/
theorem corollary_5_5 {d p q : ℕ} (hd : 2 ≤ d) : Separating d p q := by sorry

